  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You cleave truth from lies with the power of your mind and will.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Thoughtful Discernment<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain an additional number of daily uses of this feat equal to one-half your mythic tier. In addition, if you expend one use of your mythic power when using this feat, you can determine whether a statement is a lie even if you did not personally hear it or if you heard it longer than one day ago. However, your ability to evaluate the statement’s truth is predicated on having an accurate report or recollection of the statement. If the statement is altered or distorted from the original, you cannot accurately evaluate its truthfulness.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
